# #1046: the string and date/time scalar functions in the column engine,
# with DuckDB's answers (ADR 0030). `strtime` is the fixture with NULLs,
# non-ASCII text and a TIMESTAMP column; `ts_edges` adds timestamp edges
# (before 1970, year 1 and 9999, NULL). Expectations written by
# `make refresh-column-sqllogictest` from DuckDB, never by hand. String
# results are wrapped in '[' || .. || ']' where they could be blank, the
# format's blank line ends a record block.

# ---- string family over text with NULLs, empty and non-ASCII values ----

